# Track the source material and the current five chapter projects.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/*.py
!/*.pptx
!/*.pdf
!/*.docx
!/课后作业答案/
!/第一章-完善版讲义/
!/第二章-完善版讲义/
!/第三章-完善版讲义/
!/第四章-完善版讲义/
!/第五章-完善版讲义/

# Generated archives, previews, compiler files, and caches stay local.
*.zip
*.rar
*.aux
*.log
*.toc
*.out
*.xdv
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Retain authoring/check scripts but omit bulky working artifacts.
**/工作文件/*
!**/工作文件/*.py
!**/工作文件/*.json
!**/工作文件/*.md
**/*备份*/
**/资料核查/*
!**/资料核查/*.json
!**/资料核查/*.md
